    <string-array name="insults_version_a">
        <item>Seriously, still there??</item>
        <item>Get up, you ornament!</item>
        <item>Get out of that screen!</item>
        <item>A doormat with a password!</item>
        <item>Save! Shut down! Vanish!</item>
        <item>I\'m done. Are you?</item>
    </string-array>

    <string-array name="insults_version_b">
        <item>Did someone glue you there?</item>
        <item>Move it, paperweight!</item>
        <item>Let go of that keyboard!</item>
        <item>A stapler with a salary!</item>
        <item>Close! Unplug! Walk!</item>
        <item>The chair stays. You go.</item>
    </string-array>

    <string-array name="insults_version_c">
        <item>One last thing? Sure.</item>
        <item>Wake up, office hamster!</item>
        <item>Drop that damn mouse!</item>
        <item>Employee of the year, with a screensaver!</item>
        <item>Enough! Close! Out!</item>
        <item>It\'s over. Deal with it.</item>
    </string-array>

    <string-array name="insults_version_d">
        <item>Oh, you\'re still here? What a surprise.</item>
        <item>On your feet, desk ficus!</item>
        <item>Get those fingers off the keys!</item>
        <item>A Post-it with legs!</item>
        <item>Shut down! Get up! Get out!</item>
        <item>I\'m unplugging. Do what you want.</item>
    </string-array>

    <string-array name="insults_version_e">
        <item>Just a sec, right? Like yesterday.</item>
        <item>Come on, coat rack!</item>
        <item>Stop clicking, now!</item>
        <item>A jammed printer in shoes!</item>
        <item>Drop it! Close it! Go!</item>
        <item>The screen turns itself off. You don\'t.</item>
    </string-array>

